{"id":5216,"date":"2024-12-06T22:35:26","date_gmt":"2024-12-06T14:35:26","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=5216"},"modified":"2024-12-06T22:35:26","modified_gmt":"2024-12-06T14:35:26","slug":"filter-bags-for-waste-incineration","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=filter-bags-for-waste-incineration","title":{"rendered":"Filter Bags for Waste Incineration"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>With the acceleration of global urbanization, garbage pollution is serious. Improper garbage disposal may cause serious air, water and soil pollution and occupy a large amount of land. How to solve the garbage problem has attracted great attention from the whole society.<\/p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5221\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Waste-Incineration-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Waste-Incineration-detail1.jpg 1200w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Waste-Incineration-detail1-300x157.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Waste-Incineration-detail1-1024x536.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Waste-Incineration-detail1-768x402.jpg 768w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Waste-Incineration-detail1-600x314.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><\/p>\n<h3>Features of Waste Incineration Filter Bags<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>High Temperature Resistance<\/strong>: These bags must withstand continuous exposure to temperatures ranging from 200\u00b0C to 260\u00b0C, and in some cases even higher.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Chemical Resistance<\/strong>: Flue gases from waste incineration contain acidic and corrosive substances such as sulfur dioxide (SO\u2082), hydrochloric acid (HCl), and nitrogen oxides (NO\u2093).<\/li>\n<li><strong>Fine Particle Capture<\/strong>: Filter bags used for waste incineration need to capture ultrafine particulate matter (PM2.5) to prevent harmful pollutants from being released into the environment.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Durable and Long Life<\/strong>: Due to the harsh conditions of waste incineration, filter bags are designed to have a long service life, reducing the need for frequent replacement and maintenance.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr \/>\n<h3>Materials and Performance<\/h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td id=\"sjs-A1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Material\">Material<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-B1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Temperature Resistance\">Temperature Resistance<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-C1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Chemical Resistance\">Chemical Resistance<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-D1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Strength\">Strength<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td id=\"sjs-A2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"PPS (Polyphenylene Sulfide)\">PPS (Polyphenylene Sulfide)<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-B2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 190\u2103- 200C\">Up to 190\u2103- 200\u2103<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-C2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent to acids, fair to alkalis\">Excellent to acids, fair to alkalis<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-D2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td id=\"sjs-A3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"P84 (Polyimide)\">P84 (Polyimide)<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-B3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 260C\">Up to 260\u2103<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-C3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Good to acids and alkalis\">Good to acids and alkalis<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-D3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Very High\">Very High<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td id=\"sjs-A4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"PTFE (Teflon)\">PTFE (Teflon)<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-B4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 260C\">Up to 260\u2103<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-C4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Outstanding to both acids and\">Outstanding to both acids andalkalis<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-D4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Moderate\">Moderate<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td id=\"sjs-A9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Fiberglass\">Fiberglass<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-B9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 260C\">Up to 260\u2103<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-C9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Moderate chemical resistance, can be enhanced with PTFE coating\">Moderate chemical resistance, can be enhanced with PTFE coating<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-D9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td id=\"sjs-A10\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Nomex (Aramid)\">Nomex (Aramid)<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-B10\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 200\u2103\">Up to 200\u2103<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-C10\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Good chemical resistance, moderate to acids, poor to alkalis\">Good chemical resistance, moderate to acids, poor to alkalis<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-D10\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td id=\"sjs-A11\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Ryton\">Ryton(Polyphenylene Sulfide \u2013 PPS)<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-B11\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 190\u00b0C\">Up to 190\u00b0C<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-C11\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent chemical resistance\">Excellent chemical resistance<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-D11\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>Advantages of Philite\u00ae Dust Collection Filter Bags<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Meet emission standards: Effectively reduce particulate emissions and meet strict environmental regulations.<\/li>\n<li>Improve air quality: Helps prevent toxic substances and pollutants from entering the atmosphere.<\/li>\n<li>Energy efficiency: By capturing more particulate matter, waste incineration plants can operate more efficiently.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5222\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/PTFE-dust-filter-bags-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"212\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/PTFE-dust-filter-bags-detail2.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/PTFE-dust-filter-bags-deta